item.spawn_egg.entity.lothlorien:elven_warden.name=Spawn-Ei: Elbenwächter
## Context: Action-bar label while the player is in the Guest band (Harmony 0 to +9): welcome, but not yet trusted. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.status.guest=Gastrecht in Lothlórien
## Context: Action-bar label while the player is in the Uneasy band (Harmony -1 to -14): the forest is uneasy about the player. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.status.uneasy=Unbehagen in Lothlórien
## Context: Action-bar label while the player is in the Shunned band (Harmony -15 to -29): the forest turns away from the player. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.status.shunned=Von Lothlórien gemieden
## Context: Action-bar label while the player is in the Hated band (Harmony -30 to -60): the forest hates the player and its wardens attack on sight. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.status.hated=Von Lothlórien gehasst
## Context: Chat line when Harmony falls from Guest (or Friend) into the Uneasy band.. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.harmony.worse.uneasy=§6Der Wald runzelt die Stirn über deine Taten.
## Context: Chat line when Harmony falls into the Shunned band (-15 to -29), from a better band.. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.harmony.worse.shunned=§cDer Wald kehrt dir den Rücken.
## Context: Chat line when Harmony falls into the Hated band (-30 or lower). Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.harmony.worse.hated=§4Die Wächter dulden deine Gegenwart nicht länger.
## Context: Chat line when Harmony rises from Hated into the Shunned band. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.harmony.better.shunned=§cDie Wächter senken ihre Bögen, doch der Wald meidet dich noch.
## Context: Chat line when Harmony rises from Shunned (or Hated) into the Uneasy band. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.harmony.better.uneasy=§6Der Zorn des Waldes weicht einem Unbehagen.
## Context: Chat line when Harmony rises from Uneasy (or lower) back to Guest (0). Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
